    {
      "start": 20.99,
      "end": 24.15,
      "text": "Finished it? Mark it claimed."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.15,
      "end": 28.93,
      "text": "Your card calendar brings benefit deadlines and annual fees into view."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.93,
      "end": 33.18,
      "text": "And step-by-step guides help you put those perks to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.18,
      "end": 35.34,
      "text": "Now there's less to enter by hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.34,
      "end": 39.34,
      "text": "The new Amex extension reads benefit progress from your signed-in account."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.34,
